          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum, nen, ceng’ ubino, eliel pamir uka; ma jukuhaya ceke, ku dhanu ceke ma timo dubo, gibibedo ni soka; e ceng’ m’ubino biwang’ugi pet, Yehova mir udul uwacu, kara kud ewek igi kadok ulage kadi jange de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento iwu wu ju ma lworo nyinga ceng’ mi bedopwe biwok ku keyokum i bombe; e wubiwok woko, man wubituko calu nyithi dhiang’ i dwol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wubinyono judubo piny; kum gibibedo ni vuru the tiendwu i ceng’ m’atimo maeni, Yehova mir udul uwacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
